{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "0e99c92b3775a66b11f74651b25c354de4e653e0660266c5c24e01f9d5ed713a",
  "bundle_request_count": 23,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:1bbe1644c139221f6ffb74eace91c4babd0e1c5656f4c0d70bfe88841db50749",
      "request_id": "1bbe1644c139221f6ffb74eace91c4babd0e1c5656f4c0d70bfe88841db50749",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4df4d459a4f569a8fd44b302135de007",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可是，往上走的日子，并不连续。二零一五年的脚伤，让她休战了大约半年。二零一六年，髋部又受伤。对一名还在建立职业生涯的球员来说，她需要先重新回到球场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d640c62da05fa4ada19d4a870cc2081147d5b4c40948ff8d3a3a921b2b829557",
      "words_sha256": "bbc811f0d44745ebbb1f9b90734af925684183fac309d5dc0bcddfb0c2003134"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2e4b36ea84c808ca12f3e3b33bea9fd10c98d04491767a90bb4449d634588969",
      "request_id": "2e4b36ea84c808ca12f3e3b33bea9fd10c98d04491767a90bb4449d634588969",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3d802af4f8dd1197c1d5da419fbb5dae",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她在采访里说，大约十三岁时，开始认真想做职业球员。二零一一年，她出战职业赛事；二零一四年，拿到第一座低级别职业赛单打冠军。次年，第一次站上巡回赛单打正赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bd262e91e441d3c76bcb945add679f44a9db04b99d6992048538a3f39cfa8e0d",
      "words_sha256": "557336940dcff41f62b9f41d144eb4e2415ac1cda59c9bbb3c4c4b0f6c90db22"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:33de592cf635fd0f1bef3e2b81ded6430c306c069e3f36bdd377c0fa9b472328",
      "request_id": "33de592cf635fd0f1bef3e2b81ded6430c306c069e3f36bdd377c0fa9b472328",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a889853ea07dcfedd558bca75056ecbc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "算上资格赛，这一周她打了七场，其中六场要打三盘。五场正赛，无一例外都是三盘。加起来二十盘球。她把自己留在比赛里，也终于把这场等待，带到了冠军点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8db3f7c119df3a193731d5a7769e5eb351dfb267e6c71d5ed155ccc399c72eeb",
      "words_sha256": "cf83dab82fc0b918980507a60f6ed5e3eeaf0a72c8c1e8aeadfbc73a4cb8b878"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:38e8d4a75f72ad7bf333e6c8e458a489e13d5d83a2d9e182e24f5baccb18a5a5",
      "request_id": "38e8d4a75f72ad7bf333e6c8e458a489e13d5d83a2d9e182e24f5baccb18a5a5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0a5e9d9cd79713c7a976f0ed03d8b520",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二年，她又从澳网资格赛打起。这次，首轮打了将近三个小时，她逆转土居美咲，拿到澳网正赛首胜。一年前一局未得的球场，她终于带走了一场胜利。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8eb67421ba66df35c3299eb603f027d157af8663d69a010af4669e0f9848bfd3",
      "words_sha256": "2422e8d18044d5233dac57f38e115bd048b108081c4b9e400aed7d5b59504d05"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3b5bf0cac5d5662319c43dda6bf23c16057b2816eb396ec21f7785012a5c75d1",
      "request_id": "3b5bf0cac5d5662319c43dda6bf23c16057b2816eb396ec21f7785012a5c75d1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5c783794e4cb21bf3770ee185afe53bd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "赢球后，她蹲在草地上，把手捂在嘴边。那个赛季，她的单打排名最高来到世界第七十。你会在大满贯集锦里看见她，却还不能在巡回赛单打冠军名单里找到她。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "876e88a4f6780c3f164219eeec3e3ec5bd769ec3d55b0e9aeb33f60268f9e3de",
      "words_sha256": "fb93a79425d0e3e763f6f901f3d2ec0bf5c45352121bb9d4177ad24f91e4852c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3edbee970f2310bda97256a37757e7f736f40058cde4410a0e171af5fbf2174f",
      "request_id": "3edbee970f2310bda97256a37757e7f736f40058cde4410a0e171af5fbf2174f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "819eb91f2e3e6a81843a73b50000afb4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "更大的突破，等到二零二二年的印第安维尔斯。又是从资格赛出发，她先后击败斯维托丽娜和卡内皮，打到第四轮。三月二十一日，二十五岁的达特，第一次进入单打世界前一百，排名第九十九。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "14a606cdc60dca21b6fe4199de0a9942642a1e2b23a468379d379768bc7914ec",
      "words_sha256": "07db49cf30990864a4bccbfcd4596f3473c4d23f725bdf7ae1828cdb1af489de"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4037c93398cab01a91cd43d6f164289226651da387f6b0539c87396c4b54e649",
      "request_id": "4037c93398cab01a91cd43d6f164289226651da387f6b0539c87396c4b54e649",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2a92983e35062ed1b80fbed31e366395",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "正赛首轮，三盘；第二轮，三盘；四分之一决赛对巴多萨，还是三盘。等她站上决赛，已经连赢六场。对她来说，这一周的难度，藏在每一场都要重新开始的决胜盘里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c6a23876f00a937170f840b5387342ba5e2363c7ceee06161db037420cb1592e",
      "words_sha256": "c4467fe52e695fff493f49130da446145cab64e09e7a88739f3e14f2bca3eb65"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6aa04732081bc6aaa71972a3b43fb575756740d1e44f69c67f5ecf0ddb76e9c5",
      "request_id": "6aa04732081bc6aaa71972a3b43fb575756740d1e44f69c67f5ecf0ddb76e9c5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "be54c5e293a4f3b2a0e38e095ef43730",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二四年，变化继续发生。一月，她在堪培拉的一百二十五级赛事拿到单打亚军。二月，在克卢日，第一次收获巡回赛单打四强成绩。她越来越接近决赛，但还没有到。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f918162584796ca178923aa70625c923bd825e5b0edea5772737b5bfc7bc78b3",
      "words_sha256": "f07bba9afd69cba31fb9e842956b39fb67540c0e74c58d30fdf215b9671f05a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:83b4eee5118be7832d1da8e2583b1ba2ff2962665524bf59f68645d9ff8224a7",
      "request_id": "83b4eee5118be7832d1da8e2583b1ba2ff2962665524bf59f68645d9ff8224a7",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "762e2271a6832f0a131fbeddf89d932c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这是夺冠前一天，半决赛后的采访。那时，她还不知道自己会成为冠军。仅仅是第一次打进巡回赛单打决赛，就已经让三十岁的达特，等了很久。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5ad87affd00cb747817bf1d296681716527b3f8d4530b28f3400fe23f5018993",
      "words_sha256": "0e05d1e16e2537433331c06e42b99f05f0967070e8e56e3a38532fa025cf6b04"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:86698cb1938c95712e4f140195aa30cafcee992ba503ec1238603be52dc20e10",
      "request_id": "86698cb1938c95712e4f140195aa30cafcee992ba503ec1238603be52dc20e10",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e32ab94304114f6cd1d060092c3c19b0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "达特等到三十岁，巡回赛单打首冠。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "72fda2553f95bba2b702ff06f1a4b266482fde07d30978f992e1cd2a1b24ce26",
      "words_sha256": "e1f9be810dfd9dd746bd305694816e5a2a157bb003fc17187b40c0413517a31b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:96fc20688af50e5e8d933dfb7a8236ee9453d8f484c2553147e438dae2149d14",
      "request_id": "96fc20688af50e5e8d933dfb7a8236ee9453d8f484c2553147e438dae2149d14",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b93cd82ffc7e3887b0583d9d7b68c868",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "来到广州时，她的单打排名是一百一十五，还要先打资格赛。第一场就先丢一盘，随后靠抢七追平，再赢下决胜盘。从冠军倒着看，那只是第一步；身处其中，她先要争取一张正赛门票。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "39faf36693b3b1bf8863cdacd2a6fc8068fca2df194ddcf6d2b65ee998a6d174",
      "words_sha256": "32b84909a89035f90304684f387cd203e06ef4dec720ae2dc470653d7d450cc2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9bdf18e241bbe37190e3608d6857ab07f18dd0d291fae3d1a61cc8740078dfd1",
      "request_id": "9bdf18e241bbe37190e3608d6857ab07f18dd0d291fae3d1a61cc8740078dfd1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0cbd08e51536c56556b4dd49398a4a83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "哈丽雅特·达特出生在伦敦汉普斯特德。七岁时，她在家附近的坎伯兰草地网球俱乐部开始打球。爸爸妈妈也在那里相识。她的网球故事，有一个很生活化的起点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "34d39a927aab75d01f74b1c2ef0cc349253723efab4f26952cd3b4215e62defa",
      "words_sha256": "d51ddefb1b0b66f335abcfcc04d65be9594bd940fc5e19b0c5e6a7acad0738f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ae41cc92616cafcc40b22eda78d6b429e0c4e53e411efe76dabf86112fcfa707",
      "request_id": "ae41cc92616cafcc40b22eda78d6b429e0c4e53e411efe76dabf86112fcfa707",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cb4059ae19c2aba3a352911d612a90c3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了二零二六年，她已经和拉姆斯登一起，在诺丁汉和布拉格拿到巡回赛双打冠军。所以广州这次，准确地说，是她的巡回赛单打首冠。这座奖盘，她一直等到三十岁。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "51ba2c2f64b67f536ca5313738c183ce4309832d3dabe91ffa966f288e92e352",
      "words_sha256": "9f4949c35d15a79e058b262ac42c40268969aaa7d2a719b4f02246a64f7b2f35"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b1d3b4ad00abff202ed0556ddb035cfc817bf0ac1daaa9332ee65b2f22a177f0",
      "request_id": "b1d3b4ad00abff202ed0556ddb035cfc817bf0ac1daaa9332ee65b2f22a177f0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e7b9743575a9cf5f959f35ee13accc70",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她的经历里，也有争议。二零二五年鲁昂站，她对布瓦松说了涉及体味的不当言论。赛后，她公开道歉，说自己对那番话感到后悔。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "64e3296913afcdcd52840f9ead622eeae47b3661eedabf38f6c15923ae973f91",
      "words_sha256": "ff3941ce6dedc6beaa863347e141fc3181432c2596e892038c9cf670a64f397a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d01422f286e7af5fcb3cad995867c7b55dc5ee16f6c86f3e3b83990789fd5f97",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:bf16ad7343978f0b780a027265a359a3801b825c5536b17e21dfbbed8b3d913b",
      "request_id": "bf16ad7343978f0b780a027265a359a3801b825c5536b17e21dfbbed8b3d913b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2ae9c350ce266cc3b81adf18c816411b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛，她面对十六岁的中国姑娘孙心然。先输五比七，第二盘四比五，又轮到自己发球。孙心然两次在平分后占先，拿到赛点。达特先后救回两个。这一分，是其中的第一次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1aa3f30ca3dcfc5b7b7e23617134d769f27f1a0fa050edfee3dc915860f3ee3b",
      "words_sha256": "247eee9a46a535d5ada0ddfb1d6eb83e73c74a0af0be9f65f682c8df7052ff0c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:cc25e6c30bd2044225cb6d952093a7704339050268a643f63fa60d7e2ecc563d",
      "request_id": "cc25e6c30bd2044225cb6d952093a7704339050268a643f63fa60d7e2ecc563d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "076813e9dfef96c21542580aa7564402",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从小时候交朋友的俱乐部，到三十岁亲吻这只冠军奖盘。达特的路，有伤病、失利，也有过需要道歉的时刻。而今天，她终于完成了单打的一次突破。如果结果来得很慢，你还愿意给自己多少时间？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c722d419df7252eaefb6cbd63a6c6e9a938bf2ee9afbd637cfb79e12e035c466",
      "words_sha256": "54ad6eb99bc87dc184d79e1184de0e4c609852ac29eb287a3962045031560986"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ce309ea18a7f7f0906d0f8d49014774bc1262e49d364d96b3e81f4ee209c6009",
      "request_id": "ce309ea18a7f7f0906d0f8d49014774bc1262e49d364d96b3e81f4ee209c6009",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8b44e82deae66218e8e6951b7a6556fc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "之后，她抢七七比一扳回一盘，决胜盘六比零，终于赢下比赛。这一次，她没有停在决赛门外。她赛后流泪，感谢团队一直陪伴自己。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f659f82eec4cc58f7b88b67a1a683ea9d21d543a63b598963efef74a11ab1b25",
      "words_sha256": "7b56db5d80cfd438c47037c056730ed3ba58840f5bf1dcc706c3cd206c839037"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:da72d9422ab6580c0aa0b777e09e9262d83acc80038268f3b631e2976e8d0fa9",
      "request_id": "da72d9422ab6580c0aa0b777e09e9262d83acc80038268f3b631e2976e8d0fa9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3d7b4255e9906fb259c59565d5757778",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那时她接受采访，说自己过去常因一场失利，难受好几个星期。后来，她学着把眼光放回每天的工作。一直努力却等不到结果，已经是她非常熟悉的经历。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c88000d932ad1a0fce40099e59209d5000a54326f8f059feb958cc2c6dd3c38f",
      "words_sha256": "4d5bfd0f2b692841fccadbe9270ff91be944ba9052591d2fbde5439431e80c33"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e59caa879654b76ecc902e8e5292b72cfdba55bcbad4219486893de5c63d3bb3",
      "request_id": "e59caa879654b76ecc902e8e5292b72cfdba55bcbad4219486893de5c63d3bb3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0cef35b3f4b06b875d8eb1b07ef3c26f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同年温网第二轮，她和博尔特打到决胜盘抢十。二比六落后，离输球越来越近。可达特把比分追了回来，最后以十比八赢下抢十。这是她第二次打进温网第三轮。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5e836b776076230572953fcf61912f0c154431153fc455cd23f1c3e50aa8fedd",
      "words_sha256": "8a777d178ebcafe79899442cc2b6567da164cd43a3751130c8f73661dc782f8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e96691f65fdfbae985d651448c06ea09a071cc9ba6b44c8ee8d417bede01ed33",
      "request_id": "e96691f65fdfbae985d651448c06ea09a071cc9ba6b44c8ee8d417bede01ed33",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e1efdc802f24fe22f4c2a4b8f866318b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决胜盘五比四，达特发球，四十比十五。这是她的第三个冠军点。先把前两个没兑现的机会放下。再发一球，再接一次来球。这一次，终于轮到她。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7d413f881b25c8c6e6089b2730dcf3a18fecc02953400b8fd46c02eab318eefc",
      "words_sha256": "2c6b773b245e997842ef1e0b1dccf5996d4206bfc76e4033c06d210ad74138dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:eb9f52bbe1559b735f0ec46b885a3974c3dda3d485fb2bdfd874a68c3480873c",
      "request_id": "eb9f52bbe1559b735f0ec46b885a3974c3dda3d485fb2bdfd874a68c3480873c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "22d60c2c5fad726da73edaa8b6cc2258",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛对面的塔格尔只有十八岁，已经拿过巡回赛单打冠军。达特三十岁，第一次打这样的决赛。先输四比六，再以六比三追回。她又一次，要在第三盘里争取结果。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8281922738cb06f67f781f769d9f5b8952d3a55704c0e19dc64edbd0305397f9",
      "words_sha256": "384d514ee925099f21a45848a3daa1daa1cc45bfbae8f32744c191fd9305ceb7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f7251b6b903d51d9e0873a49655036039a7c66ad9279f89fe31f902f9ab1bd1d",
      "request_id": "f7251b6b903d51d9e0873a49655036039a7c66ad9279f89fe31f902f9ab1bd1d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "af84a53fe194d5544860d555659c366a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零一九年澳网，二十二岁的达特连赢三场资格赛，终于走进正赛。对面是她欣赏多年的莎拉波娃。她第一次来到澳网正赛的结果，却是两个零比六。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7ca978da32265bd499b845411ae81bf3517a00f1277d2ea33c0f55490d32295d",
      "words_sha256": "7613da6baf84bd7c1df138b6d1b60952b7b8f226c2f3d01669a591d5315b552e"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5ad87affd00cb747817bf1d296681716527b3f8d4530b28f3400fe23f5018993",
      "words_sha256": "0e05d1e16e2537433331c06e42b99f05f0967070e8e56e3a38532fa025cf6b04",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "762e2271a6832f0a131fbeddf89d932c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这是夺冠前一天，半决赛后的采访。那时，她还不知道自己会成为冠军。仅仅是第一次打进巡回赛单打决赛，就已经让三十岁的达特，等了很久。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "34d39a927aab75d01f74b1c2ef0cc349253723efab4f26952cd3b4215e62defa",
      "words_sha256": "d51ddefb1b0b66f335abcfcc04d65be9594bd940fc5e19b0c5e6a7acad0738f3",
      "words_path": "voice_03.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0cbd08e51536c56556b4dd49398a4a83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "哈丽雅特·达特出生在伦敦汉普斯特德。七岁时，她在家附近的坎伯兰草地网球俱乐部开始打球。爸爸妈妈也在那里相识。她的网球故事，有一个很生活化的起点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "bd262e91e441d3c76bcb945add679f44a9db04b99d6992048538a3f39cfa8e0d",
      "words_sha256": "557336940dcff41f62b9f41d144eb4e2415ac1cda59c9bbb3c4c4b0f6c90db22",
      "words_path": "voice_05.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3d802af4f8dd1197c1d5da419fbb5dae",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她在采访里说，大约十三岁时，开始认真想做职业球员。二零一一年，她出战职业赛事；二零一四年，拿到第一座低级别职业赛单打冠军。次年，第一次站上巡回赛单打正赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d640c62da05fa4ada19d4a870cc2081147d5b4c40948ff8d3a3a921b2b829557",
      "words_sha256": "bbc811f0d44745ebbb1f9b90734af925684183fac309d5dc0bcddfb0c2003134",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4df4d459a4f569a8fd44b302135de007",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可是，往上走的日子，并不连续。二零一五年的脚伤，让她休战了大约半年。二零一六年，髋部又受伤。对一名还在建立职业生涯的球员来说，她需要先重新回到球场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7ca978da32265bd499b845411ae81bf3517a00f1277d2ea33c0f55490d32295d",
      "words_sha256": "7613da6baf84bd7c1df138b6d1b60952b7b8f226c2f3d01669a591d5315b552e",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "af84a53fe194d5544860d555659c366a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零一九年澳网，二十二岁的达特连赢三场资格赛，终于走进正赛。对面是她欣赏多年的莎拉波娃。她第一次来到澳网正赛的结果，却是两个零比六。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8eb67421ba66df35c3299eb603f027d157af8663d69a010af4669e0f9848bfd3",
      "words_sha256": "2422e8d18044d5233dac57f38e115bd048b108081c4b9e400aed7d5b59504d05",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0a5e9d9cd79713c7a976f0ed03d8b520",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二年，她又从澳网资格赛打起。这次，首轮打了将近三个小时，她逆转土居美咲，拿到澳网正赛首胜。一年前一局未得的球场，她终于带走了一场胜利。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "14a606cdc60dca21b6fe4199de0a9942642a1e2b23a468379d379768bc7914ec",
      "words_sha256": "07db49cf30990864a4bccbfcd4596f3473c4d23f725bdf7ae1828cdb1af489de",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "819eb91f2e3e6a81843a73b50000afb4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "更大的突破，等到二零二二年的印第安维尔斯。又是从资格赛出发，她先后击败斯维托丽娜和卡内皮，打到第四轮。三月二十一日，二十五岁的达特，第一次进入单打世界前一百，排名第九十九。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c88000d932ad1a0fce40099e59209d5000a54326f8f059feb958cc2c6dd3c38f",
      "words_sha256": "4d5bfd0f2b692841fccadbe9270ff91be944ba9052591d2fbde5439431e80c33",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3d7b4255e9906fb259c59565d5757778",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那时她接受采访，说自己过去常因一场失利，难受好几个星期。后来，她学着把眼光放回每天的工作。一直努力却等不到结果，已经是她非常熟悉的经历。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f918162584796ca178923aa70625c923bd825e5b0edea5772737b5bfc7bc78b3",
      "words_sha256": "f07bba9afd69cba31fb9e842956b39fb67540c0e74c58d30fdf215b9671f05a5",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "be54c5e293a4f3b2a0e38e095ef43730",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二四年，变化继续发生。一月，她在堪培拉的一百二十五级赛事拿到单打亚军。二月，在克卢日，第一次收获巡回赛单打四强成绩。她越来越接近决赛，但还没有到。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5e836b776076230572953fcf61912f0c154431153fc455cd23f1c3e50aa8fedd",
      "words_sha256": "8a777d178ebcafe79899442cc2b6567da164cd43a3751130c8f73661dc782f8c",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0cef35b3f4b06b875d8eb1b07ef3c26f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同年温网第二轮，她和博尔特打到决胜盘抢十。二比六落后，离输球越来越近。可达特把比分追了回来，最后以十比八赢下抢十。这是她第二次打进温网第三轮。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "876e88a4f6780c3f164219eeec3e3ec5bd769ec3d55b0e9aeb33f60268f9e3de",
      "words_sha256": "fb93a79425d0e3e763f6f901f3d2ec0bf5c45352121bb9d4177ad24f91e4852c",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5c783794e4cb21bf3770ee185afe53bd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "赢球后，她蹲在草地上，把手捂在嘴边。那个赛季，她的单打排名最高来到世界第七十。你会在大满贯集锦里看见她，却还不能在巡回赛单打冠军名单里找到她。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "64e3296913afcdcd52840f9ead622eeae47b3661eedabf38f6c15923ae973f91",
      "words_sha256": "ff3941ce6dedc6beaa863347e141fc3181432c2596e892038c9cf670a64f397a",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e7b9743575a9cf5f959f35ee13accc70",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她的经历里，也有争议。二零二五年鲁昂站，她对布瓦松说了涉及体味的不当言论。赛后，她公开道歉，说自己对那番话感到后悔。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "51ba2c2f64b67f536ca5313738c183ce4309832d3dabe91ffa966f288e92e352",
      "words_sha256": "9f4949c35d15a79e058b262ac42c40268969aaa7d2a719b4f02246a64f7b2f35",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cb4059ae19c2aba3a352911d612a90c3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了二零二六年，她已经和拉姆斯登一起，在诺丁汉和布拉格拿到巡回赛双打冠军。所以广州这次，准确地说，是她的巡回赛单打首冠。这座奖盘，她一直等到三十岁。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "39faf36693b3b1bf8863cdacd2a6fc8068fca2df194ddcf6d2b65ee998a6d174",
      "words_sha256": "32b84909a89035f90304684f387cd203e06ef4dec720ae2dc470653d7d450cc2",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b93cd82ffc7e3887b0583d9d7b68c868",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "来到广州时，她的单打排名是一百一十五，还要先打资格赛。第一场就先丢一盘，随后靠抢七追平，再赢下决胜盘。从冠军倒着看，那只是第一步；身处其中，她先要争取一张正赛门票。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c6a23876f00a937170f840b5387342ba5e2363c7ceee06161db037420cb1592e",
      "words_sha256": "c4467fe52e695fff493f49130da446145cab64e09e7a88739f3e14f2bca3eb65",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2a92983e35062ed1b80fbed31e366395",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "正赛首轮，三盘；第二轮，三盘；四分之一决赛对巴多萨，还是三盘。等她站上决赛，已经连赢六场。对她来说，这一周的难度，藏在每一场都要重新开始的决胜盘里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1aa3f30ca3dcfc5b7b7e23617134d769f27f1a0fa050edfee3dc915860f3ee3b",
      "words_sha256": "247eee9a46a535d5ada0ddfb1d6eb83e73c74a0af0be9f65f682c8df7052ff0c",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2ae9c350ce266cc3b81adf18c816411b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛，她面对十六岁的中国姑娘孙心然。先输五比七，第二盘四比五，又轮到自己发球。孙心然两次在平分后占先，拿到赛点。达特先后救回两个。这一分，是其中的第一次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f659f82eec4cc58f7b88b67a1a683ea9d21d543a63b598963efef74a11ab1b25",
      "words_sha256": "7b56db5d80cfd438c47037c056730ed3ba58840f5bf1dcc706c3cd206c839037",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8b44e82deae66218e8e6951b7a6556fc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "之后，她抢七七比一扳回一盘，决胜盘六比零，终于赢下比赛。这一次，她没有停在决赛门外。她赛后流泪，感谢团队一直陪伴自己。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8281922738cb06f67f781f769d9f5b8952d3a55704c0e19dc64edbd0305397f9",
      "words_sha256": "384d514ee925099f21a45848a3daa1daa1cc45bfbae8f32744c191fd9305ceb7",
      "words_path": "voice_24.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "22d60c2c5fad726da73edaa8b6cc2258",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
